WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.440 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.000
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.640 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.930 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.400 --> 01:04.400
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.890 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.350 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:29.200 --> 01:30.210
I'm Chocolat!

01:30.610 --> 01:32.680
For the Queen selection test,

01:32.680 --> 01:36.200
I came to the Human World with my
best friend and rival, Vanilla.

01:37.250 --> 01:41.380
Whoever collects the most human
hearts gets to become Queen.

01:42.280 --> 01:47.740
Vanilla's a little bit in the lead,
but I got my first pink heart!

01:48.760 --> 01:50.490
For my mom who didn't get to be Queen,

01:51.360 --> 01:52.560
I'll definitely do it!

01:55.960 --> 01:58.000
The magic lipstick hints of love...

02:13.750 --> 02:14.680
Good morning!

02:15.220 --> 02:15.780
Huh?

02:17.150 --> 02:18.250
No one's here...

02:20.460 --> 02:21.590
I'm tired...

02:21.590 --> 02:23.490
It's no use, I'm...

02:25.760 --> 02:27.030
What's with everyone?

02:27.860 --> 02:28.700
Hey, you two over there!

02:29.460 --> 02:31.730
What are you doing skipping morning practice?

02:32.200 --> 02:32.880
Huh?

02:32.600 --> 02:33.250
Uh?

02:33.440 --> 02:34.970
Not "Huh" or "Uh"...!

02:35.370 --> 02:38.270
We're scheduled to present the play tomorrow!

02:38.910 --> 02:42.210
Didn't I tell you we were starting rehearsal
in the morning yesterday?!

02:42.210 --> 02:43.280
I-I'm sorry!

02:43.480 --> 02:44.620
But, who are you?

02:45.550 --> 02:48.880
She's Manabe. The class representative,
Karen Manabe.

02:49.350 --> 02:50.850
Don't call me by that name.

02:50.850 --> 02:51.790
But it's so cute.

02:52.620 --> 02:53.720
Just "Manabe" is fine!

03:03.360 --> 03:04.730
She's on fire..

03:05.100 --> 03:06.630
What amazing power...

03:06.970 --> 03:10.070
When it comes to plays, Manabe's
personality totally changes.

03:10.940 --> 03:12.470
Romeo and Juliet, huh?

03:13.340 --> 03:14.780
Romeo is Hayato-kun.

03:15.240 --> 03:17.180
And Juliet is played by Haruka-chan.

03:19.010 --> 03:21.080
Even during the lunch break...

03:21.080 --> 03:22.780
More rehearsing for the play.

03:23.550 --> 03:25.950
I wonder if I can remember
my lines correctly?

03:26.650 --> 03:28.590
You're playing a handmaid, right?

03:29.420 --> 03:31.190
Do you have a lot of lines?

03:31.590 --> 03:36.130
Um... "Thank you very much,
Master."... that's it.

03:40.030 --> 03:42.700
What? Just that little is easy!

03:43.170 --> 03:45.440
But it's embarrassing!

03:45.870 --> 03:49.410
If we're doing it anyway, it would have been
nice to play the lead role, Romeo.

03:50.180 --> 03:54.050
Then I'd totally pick up all the
boys who came to watch!

03:54.550 --> 04:00.760
Chocolat-chan, Romeo is a boy.
The lead female role is Juliet.

04:01.260 --> 04:02.060
Really?

04:03.390 --> 04:04.160
You two over there!

04:05.390 --> 04:08.930
If you've got time to yak at each
other, hurry up and rehearse!

04:09.400 --> 04:11.000
The real performance
starts tomorrow, you know!

04:11.770 --> 04:13.300
So busy, so busy...

04:13.670 --> 04:15.840
Manabe is really into it, as always...

04:16.300 --> 04:17.870
She sure is in high spirits.

04:17.870 --> 04:18.970
Though she's a little scary...

04:21.810 --> 04:23.750
Oh, Juliet!

04:23.750 --> 04:27.680
Since that day I laid my eyes upon
thee, I hath fallen in love!

04:28.720 --> 04:30.320
Oh, Romeo-sama!

04:30.650 --> 04:32.520
This the same for me!

04:33.320 --> 04:38.030
Since that day, love's flower hath
blossomed inside mine breast!

04:38.030 --> 04:38.830
Cut!

04:39.460 --> 04:41.300
Cut, cut, cut!

04:41.930 --> 04:43.300
Unbelievable, unbelievable!

04:43.800 --> 04:44.600
Unbelievable!

04:44.930 --> 04:46.300
The love isn't coming across.

04:46.300 --> 04:48.510
Sing with love, more from the heart!

04:49.070 --> 04:50.440
It's tough, you see...

04:50.440 --> 04:54.810
This is where Juliet finally confides her feelings that she has locked up inside of her.

04:54.810 --> 04:56.880
It's the most important scene!

04:57.550 --> 04:59.520
I-I'm sorry, Manabe-san...

05:00.320 --> 05:03.850
Haruka-san. It's the audience
that should be in tears.

05:03.850 --> 05:05.290
What are we going to do
if you're the one crying?

05:06.050 --> 05:08.320
I... I'm sorry...

05:09.920 --> 05:12.760
Hey, Manabe. That's being too strict.

05:13.160 --> 05:15.030
Haruka-chan is doing her best.

05:16.660 --> 05:20.900
Hayato-kun, I'm putting on
this play! I'm serious!

05:21.400 --> 05:22.900
I got it, I got it.

05:26.440 --> 05:28.380
I'm sorry, Haruka-san.

05:29.210 --> 05:31.050
I'm going to check on wardrobe...

05:34.920 --> 05:36.650
Huh? What's wrong with Manabe?

05:37.590 --> 05:40.220
Manabe-san and you are totally
alike, Chocolat-chan...

05:40.590 --> 05:41.020
Huh?

05:43.390 --> 05:47.660
Man, why am I a watchman?

05:47.660 --> 05:49.000
It suits you perfectly!

05:50.930 --> 05:52.400
Moreover... this mustache!

05:54.140 --> 05:56.000
I'm laughing so hard it hurts!

05:56.400 --> 05:58.250
That's enough, Duke!

05:58.510 --> 06:00.040
That's it, I give up.

06:01.010 --> 06:04.950
And I just cleaned Chocolat-chan's
room up for her...

06:04.950 --> 06:06.250
How cruel...

06:06.810 --> 06:08.250
One day I'll bite her.

06:10.390 --> 06:14.760
In any case, why can't humans just
say what they feel straight out?

06:15.190 --> 06:15.690
Eh?

06:16.620 --> 06:19.960
We'd be better off if everyone
was like me and Manabe.

06:20.300 --> 06:22.130
Okay, Chocolat-chan.

06:22.800 --> 06:24.430
Then help out with the cleaning.

06:24.430 --> 06:26.500
That's right! Do some work around here!

06:26.710 --> 06:29.400
Ah, the Magical World sure is nice.

06:29.400 --> 06:31.510
Where it's better to just say what you mean;

06:31.510 --> 06:34.540
and most importantly, things just put
themselves back into place on their own,

06:34.540 --> 06:35.490
without cleaning or anything!

06:35.740 --> 06:41.280
That's because everything has a "Everything in its proper place and form" spell cast on it.

06:42.050 --> 06:44.650
Well, your magic is too
weak for that right now...

06:44.650 --> 06:45.550
Be quiet, you...

06:47.820 --> 06:49.290
I'm gonna grab a bath.

06:50.790 --> 06:52.990
She made another mess...

06:52.990 --> 06:54.330
I'm leaving the rest up to you!

06:59.970 --> 07:02.200
Phew, everything's clean.

07:02.200 --> 07:05.640
If Chocolat wasn't here,
it'd always stay this way.

07:11.250 --> 07:12.290
Hey, Vanilla.

07:13.210 --> 07:14.120
Robin-sensei.

07:15.580 --> 07:19.120
Here you go, a gift for a cute girl
who likes to keep things clean.

07:20.120 --> 07:22.160
What, what, what, what, what?

07:22.160 --> 07:24.130
I'll take that gift!

07:24.460 --> 07:27.880
No! This is for Vanilla,
who cleaned the room.

07:29.460 --> 07:30.830
Wow, she really did!

07:31.330 --> 07:33.300
She made it so clean!

07:35.340 --> 07:36.670
I tried my best.

07:36.670 --> 07:39.710
Unlike Chocolat, who just gets in the way.

07:40.040 --> 07:41.910
You've got a great personality, you know.

07:42.980 --> 07:44.010
Now, go ahead.

07:46.010 --> 07:48.220
Robin-sensei... This is...

07:48.820 --> 07:49.920
The latest...

07:50.350 --> 07:51.950
Yes... that's...

07:52.420 --> 07:54.190
The Magical World Mail Order Catalog!

07:55.370 --> 07:57.430
Aww, that's nice...

07:57.960 --> 07:59.090
I'm so happy!

08:00.560 --> 08:02.460
I should have helped out with the cleaning...

08:02.900 --> 08:05.400
Let's look at it together, Chocolat-chan.

08:05.730 --> 08:06.290
It's okay?

08:06.670 --> 08:08.870
You should be grateful.

08:09.570 --> 08:14.440
We probably don't have enough ecure
to order anything much yet...

08:15.440 --> 08:20.720
However, if you do purchase something,
make sure you use it carefully.

08:21.280 --> 08:27.160
Just as beautiful flowers have thorns,
useful things also have their price.

08:28.120 --> 08:29.890
Let's hurry and take a look at it, Vanilla!

08:29.890 --> 08:30.260
Sure.

08:31.790 --> 08:32.890
They're not listening...

08:34.000 --> 08:35.060
Wow!

08:35.060 --> 08:35.870
Amazing!

08:36.060 --> 08:39.400
A flying broom, 15,000 ecure!

08:41.200 --> 08:43.500
They also have various love potions.

08:43.500 --> 08:46.570
Ooh, and candy to make your voice super cute!

08:46.570 --> 08:48.110
They also have the "lover's mirror"

08:52.650 --> 08:53.210
But...

08:53.950 --> 08:55.080
Everything is really expensive.

08:57.620 --> 09:02.220
Alright then! Starting tomorrow, I'm
gonna pick up a lot of hearts!

09:03.690 --> 09:04.760
Oh, Chocolat-chan...

09:05.390 --> 09:05.990
Oh?

09:05.990 --> 09:06.730
What is it?

09:07.330 --> 09:10.000
"Lipstick of truth" - 200 ecure.

09:10.300 --> 09:11.830
Lipstick of truth?

09:11.830 --> 09:12.500
Yeah.

09:12.500 --> 09:16.740
"When you put this lipstick on, your true feelings will come out of your mouth." it says.

09:19.910 --> 09:21.040
Sounds kinda interesting.

09:22.940 --> 09:25.250
Chocolat-chan, are you sure
you want to buy that?

09:25.910 --> 09:26.410
Yeah.

09:26.980 --> 09:28.420
But what will you use it for?

09:28.920 --> 09:31.690
You always say what you think anyway...

09:32.650 --> 09:36.510
Well, I'm thinking that it'd be nice if everyone said what they thought,

09:36.510 --> 09:38.760
just like Manabe and me.

09:39.230 --> 09:40.330
You think?

09:41.160 --> 09:41.830
Here I go!

09:42.800 --> 09:47.200
One, two, three, four, five, six!

09:47.800 --> 09:49.370
Sugar Sugar Rune!

10:19.230 --> 10:21.390
At your service, I'm from the Magical
World Mail Order Service.

10:21.570 --> 10:23.440
I've been waiting!

10:23.440 --> 10:24.370
Fast, isn't it?

10:24.710 --> 10:26.910
Fast, cheap, and excellent.

10:27.410 --> 10:29.880
Here's the lipstick of truth you ordered.

10:31.510 --> 10:33.080
So, there you go. Thank you for your order.

10:35.280 --> 10:37.990
We'll be waiting for your next order!

10:39.550 --> 10:44.060
So if I have this lipstick, I can get everyone to say what they think, eh?

11:00.970 --> 11:04.970
Play Opening Performance

11:02.810 --> 11:07.880
Ah, what should I do?! It's almost time for
the real performance, Chocolat-chan!

11:07.880 --> 11:10.480
I'm really nervous.

11:10.790 --> 11:11.350
Aha!

11:12.950 --> 11:14.820
Vanilla, try putting on this lipstick!

11:16.020 --> 11:20.290
You can't say how tense you feel, right?

11:20.290 --> 11:23.500
So let's see if this lipstick really works!

11:25.030 --> 11:27.490
I see. Okay, I'll try putting it on.

11:31.910 --> 11:33.910
So? Have something you want to say?

11:39.450 --> 11:42.420
Aw, man. I hate this stupid play!

11:42.420 --> 11:44.790
I don't know anything about Romeo or Juliet!

11:45.420 --> 11:47.320
It should all just go away!

11:47.680 --> 11:49.120
Um, no way...

11:50.690 --> 11:51.990
V-Vanilla...

11:55.730 --> 11:57.330
Vanilla, that was great!

11:58.030 --> 12:00.900
It was because of that lipstick.

12:03.200 --> 12:04.870
This lipstick is great!

12:05.270 --> 12:07.540
This is exactly what I
need for the Human World.

12:08.010 --> 12:13.180
But Robin-sensei said to be
careful with how you use it.

12:13.180 --> 12:15.380
Hey, Kato-san, Ice-san...

12:15.380 --> 12:15.820
Huh?

12:16.820 --> 12:18.850
How is Rockin' Robin-san doing?

12:20.820 --> 12:21.320
Aye!

12:24.060 --> 12:27.960
That's so nice! He gets along
so well with his daughters!

12:27.960 --> 12:30.060
I'm so jealous, so jealous!

12:31.470 --> 12:33.230
Yup, this stuff's the best!

12:33.230 --> 12:35.600
Aw, I'm beat...

12:35.600 --> 12:36.370
Akira!

12:36.870 --> 12:37.300
Huh?

12:39.070 --> 12:39.610
Aye!

12:42.540 --> 12:43.840
Listen up, you aliens!

12:43.840 --> 12:46.710
How unfortunate of you to run into me!

12:46.710 --> 12:49.080
One day I'll uncover your true nature!

12:50.720 --> 12:54.480
Akira's thinking is the same
as his actions, I guess.

12:55.760 --> 12:58.460
What's this? Haruka-san is absent?

12:58.860 --> 13:02.850
It seems she suddenly came down with a fever. It looks like she won't be here today.

13:03.160 --> 13:05.700
No... What should we do?

13:06.130 --> 13:08.600
Without Juliet, we can't do anything.

13:09.040 --> 13:10.910
Ah, it's all over...

13:11.510 --> 13:15.240
Indeed, it looks like our
class has to back out.

13:17.450 --> 13:20.680
My Romeo and Juliet is...

13:20.680 --> 13:21.950
What's the big deal?

13:24.590 --> 13:25.850
Just do it anyway.

13:26.720 --> 13:28.020
It's not that simple.

13:28.520 --> 13:32.200
Such a difficult role, who can replace her?

13:32.660 --> 13:33.630
I'll do it!

13:33.630 --> 13:36.160
Chocolat-chan, you don't have
the lines memorized, do you?

13:36.160 --> 13:38.250
Oh. Then, how about you do it, Manabe?

13:38.700 --> 13:39.130
Huh?

13:40.170 --> 13:42.270
You've memorized the lines, right?

13:45.370 --> 13:47.480
That's right, you should try it, Manabe.

13:50.540 --> 13:51.140
I can't.

13:52.510 --> 13:54.930
For me to confess love...

13:55.800 --> 13:56.800
It wouldn't be believable!

13:58.150 --> 13:58.650
Huh?

14:01.160 --> 14:02.560
It's not in my character!

14:07.060 --> 14:10.700
Manabe-san's heart,
it's a pretty pink color.

14:11.170 --> 14:13.300
Manabe must like Hayato.

14:14.270 --> 14:19.810
I'm not kidding. To be in a love
scene with Hayato...

14:21.310 --> 14:24.780
Even if it's just a play, I couldn't
tell him that I like him.

14:27.550 --> 14:30.320
You must really like Hayato-kun.

14:30.790 --> 14:32.520
So why don't you just tell him?

14:33.090 --> 14:37.360
Then the play'd be fixed, and
he'd know your true feelings.

14:38.190 --> 14:39.430
This isn't like you, Manabe.

14:44.970 --> 14:47.600
Hey, Kato-san... What are you making me do?

14:48.270 --> 14:53.010
After talking with everyone, it's best that you play the part of Juliet after all, Manabe.

14:53.770 --> 14:55.240
You're our class representative, right?

14:56.740 --> 14:57.980
Fine, just this once.

14:58.810 --> 14:59.910
Manabe, look over here.

15:00.350 --> 15:00.870
Huh?

15:04.650 --> 15:05.990
W-What was that?

15:07.290 --> 15:08.520
A spell to give you courage.

15:10.790 --> 15:12.430
Do it right, class-rep!

15:13.390 --> 15:15.000
H-Hey, wait!

15:23.800 --> 15:25.810
Chocolat-chan, you're so forcible.

15:26.340 --> 15:29.240
You think? Well, the lipstick's
for times like this.

15:29.710 --> 15:31.550
Oh, Juliet!

15:32.310 --> 15:37.550
Since the day I laid my eyes upon
thee, I hath fallen in love!

15:38.950 --> 15:40.590
Oh, Romeo-sama!

15:41.260 --> 15:42.990
This the same for me!

15:44.460 --> 15:49.280
Those sakura blossoms...
since the day we met...

15:50.760 --> 15:56.000
Inside my breast, love's flower
has always, always bloomed!

15:57.610 --> 15:58.870
Good going, Manabe!

15:58.870 --> 16:00.610
Just like the script!

16:01.640 --> 16:03.440
But the real test is now!

16:07.150 --> 16:12.820
Oh, Romeo-sama! I... I...

16:22.960 --> 16:28.300
I... Even though you're a boy,
you have long eyelashes...

16:28.300 --> 16:30.710
And your fingers are more
slender than mine...

16:30.970 --> 16:33.210
But... that stuff doesn't matter.

16:33.540 --> 16:36.280
The image of you I have from
the entrance ceremony...

16:36.840 --> 16:39.810
Someone who picks stuff out of
his onigiri before eating it...

16:40.750 --> 16:43.230
That picture of you,
everything about it, I...

16:51.030 --> 16:52.890
What's wrong with Manabe-san?

16:52.890 --> 16:54.660
Those lines aren't in the script, are they?

16:55.030 --> 16:56.450
So like, what's going on?

16:56.830 --> 16:57.900
Manabe, you can do it!

16:58.270 --> 16:59.200
Speak once more!

17:03.670 --> 17:05.970
Manabe, what are you doing?

17:17.850 --> 17:19.090
No!!

17:24.490 --> 17:26.560
What should I do?

17:26.560 --> 17:30.300
I've ruined the play!

17:32.930 --> 17:33.530
Manabe...

17:34.070 --> 17:36.270
I'm sorry... I'm sorry..

17:41.510 --> 17:42.410
I'm sorry!

17:43.620 --> 17:44.340
Manabe!

17:47.010 --> 17:49.080
I somehow feel sorry for Manabe-san.

17:50.120 --> 17:52.350
Up until today, she was always
working the hardest.

17:54.460 --> 17:56.260
Manabe-san likes Hayato-kun.

17:59.290 --> 18:01.100
When coming back from the
school entrance ceremony.

18:01.700 --> 18:04.200
If it's under the sakura
blossoms, I can say it.

18:04.530 --> 18:04.970
Manabe.

18:05.670 --> 18:06.600
Hayato-kun.

18:07.800 --> 18:08.570
I...

18:11.340 --> 18:13.770
I'm sorry. I...

18:27.820 --> 18:30.160
Vanilla, please lend me your power.

18:33.430 --> 18:34.660
Sugar Sugar Rune!

18:35.160 --> 18:36.060
Choco Rune!

18:48.340 --> 18:48.980
Wand!

18:57.880 --> 18:58.710
Alright!

19:01.760 --> 19:03.060
Sugar Sugar Rune!

19:03.890 --> 19:04.960
Vani Rune!

19:07.290 --> 19:07.730
Wand!

19:10.500 --> 19:13.030
Sakura flowers, bloom forth!

19:20.740 --> 19:24.240
Just as the day they met at the entrance ceremony!

19:50.570 --> 19:51.840
Why are you crying?

19:53.340 --> 19:54.540
It's sad.

19:58.950 --> 20:02.510
The flowers are being blown away by the wind.

20:14.160 --> 20:18.870
I... you...

20:28.810 --> 20:29.940
I've fallen in love with you.

21:09.480 --> 21:12.450
Hayato-kun was really cute as a first grader.

21:12.820 --> 21:15.990
That's when Manabe-san fell in love with him.

21:16.320 --> 21:21.300
She always kept it in, never accepting
her feelings for him.

21:24.630 --> 21:27.000
Human hearts are complicated.

21:27.700 --> 21:30.270
All that's important is collecting them.

21:31.000 --> 21:32.540
I took plenty of them.

21:34.710 --> 21:36.280
Eh?! When did you...

21:36.840 --> 21:39.200
Well, when it was my part...

21:39.880 --> 21:42.220
Thank you very much, Master.

21:47.620 --> 21:48.920
Sugar Sugar Rune!

21:49.720 --> 21:50.660
Vani Rune!

21:53.390 --> 21:53.960
Wand!

21:55.330 --> 21:57.330
Heart, heart, please come to me!

22:05.210 --> 22:06.510
Really?!

22:09.810 --> 22:12.080
She got us!

22:23.080 --> 22:29.390
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.520 --> 22:30.890
"Love"

22:31.830 --> 22:35.330
A magic spell.

22:37.500 --> 22:44.770
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.200 --> 22:54.280
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:55.950 --> 23:00.220
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.820 --> 23:03.890
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.190 --> 23:11.260
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.630 --> 23:16.070
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.070 --> 23:26.180
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.240 --> 23:35.090
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:45.710 --> 23:49.200
Mochizuki-sensei is paying a visit to our house?

23:49.200 --> 23:51.600
Doesn't she just want to meet Robin?

23:51.600 --> 23:56.310
Even though Robin is gorgeous, popular, and in good spirits, will it be okay?

23:56.310 --> 23:59.020
Ah, I'll predict it with this fortune telling book.

23:59.020 --> 24:01.860
How can we use magic to give our teacher a good impression?

24:01.860 --> 24:04.960
Wait, it'd be bad if she discovers that we can use magic!

24:06.190 --> 24:07.990
